    "created_at": "2023-04-07T07:01:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-07T07:01:31Z",
    "body": "> * initiator origin: I think we want a new opaque origin for top-level about:blanks or `javascript:'a string'`.\r\n\r\nHere is a fun fact! If you navigate to `javascript:'a string'` (via a bookmark), the resulting page has `self.origin` equal to the origin of the page you just left! Whereas, `self.origin === \"null\"` for `about:blank`. So, I guess we need to special-case the `javascript:` case to actually pull the initiator origin from the currently-active document!",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
